        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6571 Classic Mortise Concord Handleset with 5000 Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional Baldwin made Concord handleset is fashioned out of solid brass. It is available many beautiful finishes including lifetime polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and venetian bronze. It features the classic beautiful two piece square design. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". The Concord 6571 Mortise Door Entrance Set is available as either a single cylinder or a dummy set.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/classic-2-inch-knobset-baldwin-5000\"><b>Baldwin 5000 Half-Round Knobset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6571 Concord Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Estates Collection Concord Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5000 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 3-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate: 1-7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6571.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Concord Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
